# Frontend

Read `docs/frontend.md`. Use skill `firona-frontend`.

- Call the API with relative paths (`/api/...`). Never hardcode `:8000` or `:5173`.
- Do not add a Vite proxy to Django; nginx is the gateway.
- Behind Compose, HMR must use `HMR_CLIENT_PORT` (public nginx port).
- UI strings in French.
- Tokens + motion rules in `docs/frontend.md` (transform/opacity only, reduced motion, lite mode).
